NHL94AGA - native Amiga 1200 AGA port of NHL '94 (see Credits.txt)

Needs: Kickstart 3.0 or newer, a 68020 or better, the AGA chipset (Amiga 1200, 4000, CD32
hardware). The port targets an A1200 with Fast RAM. A stock A1200 (2 MB Chip RAM, no Fast
RAM) runs these checks too, more slowly. There is no picture or sound yet.

Boot this disk and it runs NHL94VFY, which plays the repository's input scripts through the
game's logic and checks and times every pass. It needs your own dump of the 1 MB US/Europe
cartridge (NHL94ROM:nhl94.bin, RAM:nhl94.bin, beside the program, or on two floppies).
From a Shell: NHL94VFY <script>, NHL94VFY <script> INTENT (the display requests), and
NHL94AGA (the boot and takeover test; it gives the machine back when you press the left
mouse button or a fire button). Logs go to NHL94VFY.log and NHL94AGA.log on this disk (or
RAM: when the disk is write-protected). Changelog.txt says what each version does.
